<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="de"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1804361732"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1544722766"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Machine Gun"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Jinja / KIRA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Machine Gun"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:42.851"><div begin="00:13.000" end="03:42.851"><p begin="00:13.000" end="00:16.200" itunes:key="L139974">Sein wir ein klein wenig dreckig<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的生活真是糟糕透了</span></p><p begin="00:15.700" end="00:17.506" itunes:key="L139975">Ein klein wenig schmutzig<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">糟糕透了</span></p><p begin="00:17.406" end="00:19.252" itunes:key="L161750">Ein wenig eklig<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真是糟糕透顶</span></p><p begin="00:19.507" end="00:22.156" itunes:key="L139977">Komm schon, zu früh kann es nie sein<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但一切还为时不晚</span></p><p begin="00:22.166" end="00:23.745" itunes:key="L139978">Ich brauch denn Kick wirklich<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我真的需要刺激一下自己</span></p><p begin="00:23.755" end="00:25.644" itunes:key="L163826">Los, lass uns beginnen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 让我们开始吧</span></p><p begin="00:25.654" end="00:28.547" itunes:key="L139980">Sonst gehts nicht, glaub für Gewohnheit<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">否则我们就无药可救了 我们需要养成良好的习惯</span></p><p begin="00:28.557" end="00:32.009" itunes:key="L139981">Glaube für Spaß, so mach ich das halt<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想拥有快乐的生活</span></p><p begin="00:32.205" end="00:36.341" itunes:key="L139983">Los, komm schon, wirst du nicht unruhig?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 不要焦躁不安</span></p><p begin="00:36.351" end="00:38.407" itunes:key="L139984">All die Leute, all die Leute schreien<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有人</span></p><p begin="00:38.607" end="00:41.994" itunes:key="L139987">Einfach unglaublich<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都大为震惊</span></p><p begin="00:42.004" end="00:45.095" itunes:key="L139988">Und es trifft dich, bevor dus wahrnimmst, Baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 不经意间我就能俘获你的心</span></p><p begin="00:45.105" end="00:48.190" itunes:key="L139989">Denn ein jeder weiß<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要让所有人都知道</span></p><p begin="00:48.300" end="00:51.595" itunes:key="L139990">Denn ein jeder weiß<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要让所有人都知道</span></p><p begin="00:51.605" end="00:55.508" itunes:key="L139991">Ich hab keine Angst hier heut Nacht loszugehen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今夜 我已无所畏惧</span></p><p begin="00:56.552" end="00:57.705" itunes:key="L139992">Ich zeigs dir<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会向你证明</span></p><p begin="00:57.909" end="01:02.155" itunes:key="L139993">Denn du weißt, ich bin bereit es einzugehen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我早已做好了万全准备</span></p><p begin="01:02.707" end="01:05.096" itunes:key="L139994">Und setzt da echt viel aufs Spiel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将铤而走险</span></p><p begin="01:05.106" end="01:06.694" itunes:key="L139995">Stehst du in meinem Weg<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使你万般阻挠</span></p><p begin="01:06.704" end="01:08.294" itunes:key="L139996">Denn ich hör nicht auf<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也不会放弃前行</span></p><p begin="01:08.304" end="01:10.750" itunes:key="L139997">Bis es nur nach mir geht, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一路向前直到我如愿以偿</span></p><p begin="01:10.760" end="01:12.393" itunes:key="L139998">Ich steh oben drauf<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我掌控着全局</span></p><p begin="01:12.403" end="01:13.594" itunes:key="L139999">Bin im Blutrausch, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我奋力拼搏</span></p><p begin="01:13.604" end="01:15.448" itunes:key="L140000">Und ich komm durch, ich komm durch<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所向披靡</span></p><p begin="01:15.458" end="01:16.948" itunes:key="L190032">Ich komm durch wie 'ne<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所向披靡</span></p><p begin="01:16.958" end="01:18.408" itunes:key="L140003">Ma-ma-machine gun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一挺机关枪</span></p><p begin="01:18.418" end="01:21.395" itunes:key="L140004">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="01:21.503" end="01:24.692" itunes:key="L140005">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="01:24.702" end="01:27.848" itunes:key="L140006">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="01:27.858" end="01:30.802" itunes:key="L140007">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="01:31.507" end="01:33.946" itunes:key="L140008">Baby, wir fang doch erst an<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 我们才刚刚开始</span></p><p begin="01:33.956" end="01:35.548" itunes:key="L140009">Dann dreh denn Scheiß auf<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们拼尽全力</span></p><p begin="01:35.558" end="01:37.640" itunes:key="L140010">Man, jag alles hoch<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">摧毁这一切吧</span></p><p begin="01:37.855" end="01:40.296" itunes:key="L140011">Los, komm schon, bleib einfach hier<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们团结在一起</span></p><p begin="01:40.306" end="01:41.899" itunes:key="L140012">Ja, flieh vor mir<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你离我而去</span></p><p begin="01:41.909" end="01:44.091" itunes:key="L140013">Doch alle sterben wir<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们都无法幸存下来</span></p><p begin="01:44.301" end="01:47.498" itunes:key="L140014">Einfach unglaublich<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有人都觉得难以置信</span></p><p begin="01:47.508" end="01:50.558" itunes:key="L140015">Und es trifft dich, bevor du es wahrnimmst, Baby<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 不经意间我就能俘获你的心</span></p><p begin="01:50.707" end="01:53.791" itunes:key="L140016">Denn ein jeder weiß<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要让所有人都知道</span></p><p begin="01:53.901" end="01:57.193" itunes:key="L140017">Denn ein jeder weiß<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要让所有人都知道</span></p><p begin="01:57.200" end="02:01.150" itunes:key="L140018">Ich hab keine Angst hier heut Nacht loszugehen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今夜 我已无所畏惧</span></p><p begin="02:02.100" end="02:03.353" itunes:key="L140019">Ich zeigs dir<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会向你证明</span></p><p begin="02:02.103" end="02:04.500" itunes:key="L183231">(Ich zeig es dir)</p><p begin="02:03.609" end="02:07.740" itunes:key="L140020">Denn du weißt, ich bin bereit, es einzugehen<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我早已做好了万全准备</span></p><p begin="02:08.300" end="02:10.741" itunes:key="L140021">Und setzt da echt viel aufs Spiel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将铤而走险</span></p><p begin="02:10.751" end="02:12.340" itunes:key="L140022">Stehst du in meinem Weg<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使你万般阻挠</span></p><p begin="02:12.350" end="02:13.895" itunes:key="L140023">Denn ich hör nicht auf<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也不会放弃前行</span></p><p begin="02:13.905" end="02:16.294" itunes:key="L140024">Bis es nur nach mir geht, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会一路向前直到我如愿以偿</span></p><p begin="02:16.304" end="02:17.991" itunes:key="L140025">Ich steh oben drauf<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我掌控着全局</span></p><p begin="02:18.001" end="02:19.191" itunes:key="L140026">Bin im Blutrausch, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我奋力拼搏</span></p><p begin="02:19.201" end="02:21.097" itunes:key="L140027">Und ich komm durch, ich komm durch<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我所向披靡</span></p><p begin="02:21.107" end="02:22.542" itunes:key="L140029">Ich komm durch, wie 'ne<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所向披靡</span></p><p begin="02:22.552" end="02:24.009" itunes:key="L140030">Ma-ma-machine gun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一挺机关枪</span></p><p begin="02:24.019" end="02:27.144" itunes:key="L140031">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="02:27.154" end="02:30.299" itunes:key="L140032">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="02:30.309" end="02:33.493" itunes:key="L140033">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="02:33.503" end="02:36.455" itunes:key="L140034">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="02:36.854" end="02:38.558" itunes:key="L140035">Ich komm dich holen, ja<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="02:38.568" end="02:39.941" itunes:key="L140036">K-komm dich hohlen, ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="02:39.951" end="02:43.294" itunes:key="L140037">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="02:43.304" end="02:44.798" itunes:key="L140038">Ich komm dich holen, ja<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="02:44.808" end="02:46.343" itunes:key="L140039">K-komm dich hohlen, ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="02:46.353" end="02:49.256" itunes:key="L140040">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="03:02.313" end="03:03.659" itunes:key="L140041">Baby, ich sags doch<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝</span></p><p begin="03:03.669" end="03:05.297" itunes:key="L140043">So gut bin ich, ich kanns noch<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我告诉过你</span></p><p begin="03:05.307" end="03:07.048" itunes:key="L140045">Bin durchgeknallt, ein Monster<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无所不能</span></p><p begin="03:07.058" end="03:08.435" itunes:key="L140047">Und wenn ich fertig bin, brauchst du echt ein' Doktor<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像一个怪物</span></p><p begin="03:08.555" end="03:10.259" itunes:key="L140048">It's G to the U to the M to the I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但一切都是虚假的</span></p><p begin="03:10.269" end="03:11.902" itunes:key="L140049">Hören wird dich keiner, also wein und schrei<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有人会听到你的哭诉和呐喊</span></p><p begin="03:11.912" end="03:13.490" itunes:key="L140050">Letzte Worte noch? Gleich ist's vorbei<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们互相道别吧</span></p><p begin="03:13.500" end="03:15.356" itunes:key="L140051">Ich werde gehen, geh hoch dabei<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要离开这里了</span></p><p begin="03:16.709" end="03:19.750" itunes:key="L140052">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="03:19.950" end="03:22.856" itunes:key="L140053">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="03:23.156" end="03:26.151" itunes:key="L140054">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="03:26.255" end="03:29.608" itunes:key="L140055">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta</p><p begin="03:29.650" end="03:30.995" itunes:key="L140056">Ich komm dich holen, ja<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="03:31.305" end="03:32.748" itunes:key="L140057">Komm dich holen, ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="03:32.758" end="03:35.849" itunes:key="L140058">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="03:36.059" end="03:37.609" itunes:key="L140059">Ich komm dich holen, ja<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="03:37.705" end="03:39.091" itunes:key="L140060">K-komm dich holen, ah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是为你而来的</span></p><p begin="03:39.201" end="03:41.994" itunes:key="L140061">Ra-ta-ta-ta, ra-ta-ta-ta-ta<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">RA Ta ta ta RA Ta ta ta</span></p><p begin="03:41.451" end="03:42.851" itunes:key="L140062">(Machine gun)</p></div></body></tt>